---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Our Vision — Sustainabox" description="Sustainabox started with a question: could a shipping container become a home we'd actually want to live in? What we built next was bigger than the home." image="/images/PXL_20260619_013004398.jpg">

	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/PXL_20260619_013004398.jpg');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Our Vision</span>
			<h1>Building More Than a Home</h1>
			<p>Built to Live In. Shared to Learn From.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section class="container content-section">

		<div class="vision-body">

			<div class="vision-opening">
				<p class="lead">Sustainabox started with a simple question:</p>
				<p class="pull-quote">Could a shipping container become a home we'd actually want to live in?</p>
				<p>The answer wasn't found in a YouTube video or a set of plans. It came through years of research, design, construction, problem solving, and learning — one decision at a time.</p>
				<p>Along the way, we realized something bigger.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="vision-divider"></div>

			<div class="vision-section">
				<p>The world doesn't need another picture-perfect container home. It needs honest information from people who have actually built one.</p>
				<p>Too many alternative housing projects are sold as simple, inexpensive, or turnkey. The reality is more nuanced. Every project involves trade-offs, unexpected challenges, and hundreds of decisions that can save — or cost — thousands of dollars.</p>
				<p>That's why Sustainabox exists.</p>
				<p>We're building a place where builders, homeowners, dreamers, and curious travelers can learn from real experience instead of marketing.</p>
				<p>Today that includes a place to stay, educational walkthroughs, consulting, and practical resources. Tomorrow it will grow into a larger ecosystem of courses, tools, design resources, AI-powered planning assistants, community, and partnerships that make alternative housing more approachable for everyone.</p>
				<p>We don't claim to have all the answers. We simply believe that sharing what we've learned — both the successes and the mistakes — helps others build better.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="vision-divider"></div>

			<!-- Principles -->
			<div class="principles-section">
				<h2>Our Principles</h2>
				<div class="principles-grid">
					<div class="principle">
						<h3>Build with intention.</h3>
						<p>Every decision should have a purpose.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="principle">
						<h3>Share what works — and what doesn't.</h3>
						<p>Real experience is more valuable than polished marketing.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="principle">
						<h3>Design for resilience.</h3>
						<p>Homes should be comfortable, durable, adaptable, and prepared for change.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="principle">
						<h3>Keep learning.</h3>
						<p>Every project teaches something worth passing on.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="vision-divider"></div>

			<!-- Closing -->
			<div class="vision-close">
				<p>This is only the beginning.</p>
				<p>Sustainabox isn't just the home we built. It's the community, knowledge, and tools we're building next.</p>
				<p class="closing-statement">Our goal isn't to build hundreds of container homes.<br>It's to help thousands of people build better ones.</p>
			</div>

		</div>

	</section>

	<section class="vision-cta">
		<div class="container">
			<a href="/stays" class="btn btn-primary">Experience It in Person</a>
			<a href="/offerings" class="btn btn-outline">See How We Can Help</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.content-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}

	.vision-body {
		max-width: 720px;
	}

	.vision-opening .lead {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.pull-quote {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-navy);
		line-height: 1.4;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.vision-opening p,
	.vision-section p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.9;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.vision-divider {
		height: 1px;
		background: #e2e8f0;
		margin: 3rem 0;
	}

	/* Principles */
	.principles-section h2 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.principles-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.principle {
		padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.principle h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}

	.principle p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Closing */
	.vision-close p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.9;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.closing-statement {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-navy) !important;
		line-height: 1.5 !important;
		margin-top: 2rem !important;
	}

	/* CTA */
	.vision-cta {
		padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
	}

	.vision-cta .container {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.pull-quote {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
		}

		.principles-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.closing-statement {
			font-size: 1.15rem !important;
		}

		.vision-cta .container {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
